		"Performance: Volume, Ribbon C1, Ribbon C2, Partial balance joystick",
		"Edit: Function, Preset User, Partial Balance Edit, Left, F1, F2, Right, Chase, Portamento, Edit, Exit, Sequencer, Write, Increment, Decrement",
